                                                "text": "Now comes perhaps the cleverest tag of all: cryptozoology. It refers to the search for new animals, animals dwelling in unexpected places, and most importantly for \"X-Files\" scriptwriters, \"cryptids\"—legendary creatures such as the yeti."
